      "value": "@{58dd3e59c3371d2985706bcb|full_name}: I've never had any issues with my internet, my rig is well above the recommended specs and I still get the exact same issues. I also accidentally start moving whenever I'm trying to use a gesture, which unsurprisingly doesn't help with motion sickness.\n\nThe Update is meant to and I quote: \"bring vive into feature equity with rift\". I'm in a group with two other Vive Users and they report the exact same things as you and me. I struggle to believe that any Vive user is happy with this update.",
      "viewerReactions": null
